{"id":"en_get-out-house-parasites","title":"Get Out, House Parasites！","titleEn":"Get Out, House Parasites！","description":"Jasper Croft, a billionaire, opens his luxury penthouse to his wife’s money-hungry relatives, but they repay him by forcing him out and stealing a treasured heirloom that belonged to his mother. During a wedding celebration, the family shows off fabricated riches on social media and subjects Jasper to humiliation, which pushes him to strike back without hesitation. Their fraudulent scheme comes to light, the parasitic relatives are arrested, and Jasper pursues legal action to recover everything he lost. Dramzio is a place where viewers can follow this series and its episodes.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/get-out-house-parasites/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/get-out-house-parasites/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Legal Justice","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcuma/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_get-out-house-parasites_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcuma/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_get-out-house-parasites_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcuma/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_get-out-house-parasites_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcuma/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_get-out-house-parasites_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (A